hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2854","###
 Narrated to us Yusuf bin Musa, who said: Narrated to us Jarir, on the authority of Al-A'mash, on the authority of Umarah bin Umair, on the authority of Abdur-Rahman bin Yazid, who said: Abdullah (RA) said, ""I did not see the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) pray any prayer except at its prescribed time, except for these two prayers: I saw him pray the Isha and Maghrib prayers together at Muzdalifah, and he prayed the Fajr"
